---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { business, hasEmail, hasPhone } from "../data/business";

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: "Home", href: "/" },
  { label: "Privacy Policy", href: "/privacy-policy/" },
];

// Update this whenever the policy changes.
const effective = "October 6, 2026";
const site = business.siteUrl.replace(/^https?:\/\//, "");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | GM Roofing"
  description="How GM Roofing collects, uses and protects the information you share through gmroofs.com, including estimate requests, calls, texts and email."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  finalCta={false}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy <em>policy.</em>" lede={`Effective ${effective}`} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        This policy explains how {business.legalName} ("{business.name}", "we", "us") collects, uses and shares information when you visit {site},
        request an estimate, or contact us by phone, text or email. If you have questions, you can reach us using the details at the bottom of this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you fill out our estimate form, call, text or email us, we collect what you share, such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, phone number and email address</li>
        <li>Your property address or ZIP code</li>
        <li>The service you're interested in and any details or photos you send about your roof</li>
        <li>Your communication preferences, including whether you've agreed to receive marketing messages</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider records basic technical information when you visit, such as your
        IP address, browser type, the pages you view and the date and time of your visit. When you play a video on our site, our video provider may record playback
        information (for example, whether the video loaded and how long it played) so the video can be delivered reliably.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Cookies.</strong> Our site does not use advertising cookies. If we add analytics or advertising tools in the future, we will update this policy to
        describe them.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your request and schedule an inspection, estimate or appointment</li>
        <li>To prepare quotes, perform work, send invoices and process payments</li>
        <li>To send appointment reminders, project updates and follow-up messages about your job</li>
        <li>To ask for feedback or a review after your project is complete</li>
        <li>
          To send marketing messages about our services, seasonal roof care tips, promotions and offers, by email, phone or text, as described in <a href="#marketing">Marketing messages</a> below
        </li>
        <li>To keep records of our work, meet legal and warranty obligations, and protect against fraud or misuse of our site</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="marketing">Marketing messages</h2>
      <p>
        We may use the contact information you give us to send you marketing emails and, where permitted, marketing calls or text messages about {business.name}'s
        services. We send marketing text messages only if you have agreed to receive them, and agreeing is never a condition of getting an estimate or hiring us.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> every marketing email includes an unsubscribe link.</li>
        <li><strong>Text messages:</strong> reply STOP at any time to stop receiving texts, or HELP for help. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li><strong>Any channel:</strong> you can also ask us directly to stop sending marketing messages using the contact details below.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Opting out of marketing does not stop messages about a project you've scheduled with us, such as appointment reminders or invoices.
      </p>

      <h2>Service providers we use</h2>
      <p>
        We use trusted third-party services to run our business. They receive only the information needed to perform their service for us and are not allowed to
        sell it. These include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Jobber</strong>, our customer management and scheduling software, where we store customer and job details and from which we may send quotes,
          invoices, reminders and messages
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Zapier</strong>, an automation tool that moves information between the apps we use, for example sending a new estimate request from our website
          into Jobber
        </li>
        <li><strong>Netlify</strong>, which hosts this website and receives estimate form submissions</li>
        <li><strong>Mux</strong>, which hosts and streams the videos on our site</li>
        <li>Email, phone and text messaging providers we use to communicate with you</li>
        <li>Payment processors, if you pay an invoice online</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Each of these companies handles information under its own privacy policy. Our site also links to our Yelp and Instagram pages. Those sites are run by
        other companies and have their own privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>How we share information</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it with other companies for their own marketing.</strong> We share information
        only:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>With the service providers listed above, to operate our business</li>
        <li>With manufacturers or suppliers when needed to register a product warranty for your roof</li>
        <li>When required by law, or to protect our rights, our customers or the public</li>
        <li>As part of a sale, merger or transfer of our business, in which case this policy would continue to apply to your information</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>
        We keep customer and job records for as long as needed to provide our services, honor warranties and meet legal, tax and accounting requirements. Estimate
        requests that don't become jobs are kept for a reasonable period in case you follow up, then deleted or anonymized.
      </p>

      <h2>How we protect information</h2>
      <p>
        Our site is served over a secure HTTPS connection, and we use reputable providers with their own security safeguards. No method of transmission or storage
        is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices and California privacy rights</h2>
      <p>We serve customers in California. Regardless of where you live, you can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tell you what personal information we have about you and how we've used it</li>
        <li>Correct information that is inaccurate</li>
        <li>Delete your information, except where we need to keep it to complete a job, honor a warranty or meet a legal requirement</li>
        <li>Stop sending you marketing messages</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To make a request, contact us using the details below. We may need to confirm your identity before acting on a request, and we will not treat you
        differently for making one. Because we do not sell or share personal information for targeted advertising, there is nothing to opt out of in that
        respect. Our site does not respond differently to browser "Do Not Track" signals.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Our services are for property owners and managers. Our site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will post the updated version on this page and change the effective date above.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        {business.legalName}<br />
        {business.address.addressLocality}, {business.address.addressRegion}<br />
        {hasEmail && <>Email: <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a><br /></>}
        {hasPhone && <>Phone: <a href={`tel:${business.phone.tel}`}>{business.phone.display}</a></>}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
